<WizardContent @headerText="Initialization" @glyph="tour">
  <WizardSection
    @headerText="Setting up your root keys"
    @docText="Learn: Initialization"
    @docPath="/intro/getting-started/deploy.html#initializing-the-vault"
  >
    <p>
      This is the very first step of setting up a Redacto KMS server. Redacto KMS comes with an important security feature
      called a "seal", which lets you shut down and secure your Redacto KMS installation if there is a security breach. This
      is the default state of Redacto KMS, so it is currently sealed since it was just installed. To unseal Redacto KMS, you
      will need to provide the key(s) that you generate here.
    </p>
  </WizardSection>
</WizardContent>